  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aruba Youth Media Lab</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Aruba Youth Media Lab
Fostering a youth-led media hub to bring stories from young people in Aruba ages between 11 to 16 years old to the community.. The Aruba Youth Media Lab is not just about learning the basics of journalism; it&amp;#39;s about actively participating and using their voice. Throughout this program, participants will delve into print, audio, visual, and digital journalism, focusing on their storytelling abilities to cater specifically to their peers. During the program, the participants will learn from media experts and journalists how to make news bytes and reels resulting in five news broadcasts they will also have written, produced, and recorded.</narrative>
  </description>
